<title>USA: NeoPath names Mel Schatz as COO.</title>
<headline>NeoPath names Mel Schatz as COO.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>NeoPath Inc said it named Mel Schatz as vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He most recently worked as divisional vice president and sector general manager at Abbott Laboratories Inc.  </p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said the position was a newly created job.</p>
